TEXT -144 320 Left 2 !.ac dec 4000 100Meg 1000Meg
TEXT -144 392 Left 2 !.param Lval=10n
TEXT -144 368 Left 2 !.param Cres=36p
TEXT -144 344 Left 2 !.param Ccpl=4.2p
TEXT 232 352 Left 2 ;Cres = shunt resonator caps (C2,C3): sets CENTER (bigger -> lower f).\nCcpl = series I/O coupling caps (C1,C4): sets BANDWIDTH (smaller -> narrower, more rejection, until IL rises from undercoupling).\nL1/L2/L3 = 10nH Coilcraft 0402HP-10NXGRW (Q~55@437, SRF 4.7GHz, wirewound). Tune Cres for 437 center, then Ccpl for >30 dB at 291.
TEXT -144 416 Left 2 !.param Q=55
TEXT -144 440 Left 2 !.param RsL={2*3.14159265*437e6*Lval/Q}
TEXT -144 464 Left 2 !.param Cp=0.11p
TEXT -144 488 Left 2 !.meas AC S21_peak MAX mag(2*V(out))
TEXT -144 512 Left 2 !.meas AC f_center WHEN mag(2*V(out))=S21_peak
TEXT -144 536 Left 2 !.meas AC IL_437 FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 437Meg
TEXT -144 560 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_fund FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 145.67Meg
TEXT -144 584 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_2nd FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 291.3Meg
TEXT -144 608 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_4th FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 582.7Meg
TEXT 240 328 Left 2 ;437 MHz 3-pole BPF -- AS BUILT (comms Rev A). L=15nH C86059 (Q~17@437), series C=10pF, shunt C=6.8pF. Ideal-value center is high (~610 MHz); values need re-tuning to 437.
